      "title": "DNS: Fix DNSKEY flags naming",
      "message": "DNS: Fix DNSKEY flags naming\n\nReserved flags were previously named 'Key Signing Key'.\nAdditionally, renamed 'Secure Entry Point' (SEP) field, which was\npreviously named 'Key Signing Key' (KSK). The SEP field is typically\nused to indicate a KSK, but this is not the correct name.\n\nAI-Assisted: no\n",
      "author_name": "Martin Mayer",
      "author_email": "martin.mayer@m2-it-solutions.de",
      "authored_date": "2026-06-29T11:10:59.000+02:00",
